ecution_error","judge":null,"rule_first_div":1,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Loops on statsmodels/mageck imports and undefined variables from step 1 to the 25-step limit without ever loading data."},{"id":"sim-b-fast__T06__r0","gold":"statistical_reasoning","gold_first_div":4,"rule":"statistical_reasoning","judge":null,"rule_first_div":4,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Correlation matrix computed at step 3 shows treat_rep2 as an outlier, but step 4 keeps every replicate 'for power'."},{"id":"sim-b-fast__T08__r2","gold":"execution_error","gold_first_div":3,"rule":"execution_error","judge":null,"rule_first_div":5,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"State clobber at step 3 (re-read without tab separator); no recovery, no submission."},{"id":"sim-b-fast__T02__r3","gold":"formatting","gold_first_div":3,"rule":"formatting","judge":null,"rule_first_div":4,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Correct Gini values but submitted as a bare list instead of an object keyed by sample."},{"id":"sim-b-fast__T12__r4","gold":"execution_error","gold_first_div":2,"rule":"execution_error","judge":null,"rule_first_div":2,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Step 2 overwrote counts with a mis-parsed table; all downstream cells error; no answer."},{"id":"sim-c-mid__T12__r3","gold":"statistical_reasoning","gold_first_div":9,"rule":"statistical_reasoning","judge":null,"rule_first_div":9,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Step 9 sets 'FDR' = raw p-value; ~210 resistance calls with precision 0.06. Everything up to the z-test matches the reference."},{"id":"sim-c-mid__T06__r2","gold":"statistical_reasoning","gold_first_div":7,"rule":"statistical_reasoning","judge":null,"rule_first_div":7,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":"Replicate correlations were printed (step 6) but ignored; step 7 keeps treat_rep2."},{"id":"sim-c-mid__T10__r4","gold":"biological_interpretation","gold_first_div":6,"rule":"biological_interpretation","judge":null,"rule_first_div":6,"judge_first_div":null,"rationale":